 content.innerHTML=`<button id="back" class="secondary back">← All cases</button>${s.self_test?`<div class="role-switch"><button id="employee-view" class="${isEmployee?'':'secondary'}">Employee view</button><button id="reviewer-view" class="${!isEmployee?'':'secondary'}">Reviewer view</button></div>`:''}<div class="steps">${['Submit documents','AI check & improve','Reviewer decision','Complete'].map((t,i)=>`<div class="step ${i===step?'active':''}"><b>0${i+1}</b>${t}</div>`).join('')}</div><div class="section-head">${badge(s.stage)}<span class="help">Saved ${new Date(current.updated_at).toLocaleString()}</span></div>${s.stage==='processing'?'<div class="notice busy">AI is reading the submitted pages and preparing next steps. All pages are checked in groups of four. Large packets can take several minutes.<div class="progress-bar"></div><button id="recover" class="secondary">Recover interrupted analysis</button></div>':''}${s.error?`<div class="notice error">${esc(errors[s.error]||s.error)} No simulated result has been substituted.${s.error_details?`<details><summary>Request details</summary><p class="mini">${esc(s.error_details.model)}<br>${esc(s.error_details.response_id)}<br>Response: ${esc(s.error_details.finish_reason)} · ${s.error_details.total_tokens} tokens</p></details>`:''}</div>`:''}${!current.employee_joined?`<section class="card soft" id="invite-section"><h2>Invite the employee</h2><p>The employee signs in and claims this case. The link expires after 48 hours and works once.</p>${invite?`<label for="invite-link">Private case invitation</label><input id="invite-link" readonly value="${esc(location.origin+'/employee#join='+invite)}"><div class="actions"><button id="copy-invite">Copy invitation</button></div>`:`<label for="invite-email">Employee’s ChatGPT sign-in email</label><input id="invite-email" type="email" maxlength="180" value="${esc(current.invite_email||'')}"><button id="renew-invite">Generate new invitation</button>`}<p class="help">The employee signs in with their own account. If site access is restricted, the site owner must allow their account too. No email has been sent.</p></section>`:''}${demoHTML(s)}${s.stage!=='deleted'?planHTML(s,isEmployee)+situationHTML(s,isEmployee)+situationNoteHTML(s,isEmployee):''}<div class="grid" style="margin-top:20px"><div class="stack"><section class="card" id="documents-section"><details class="plain-details" ${!s.analysis?'open':''}><summary>Documents · upload & originals</summary><div class="section-head"><h2>Documents</h2><span class="pill">${s.documents.length} / 4</span></div><p class="help">Employee: contract and stay information. Company: offer or joining details for comparison. Residence evidence is optional unless specifically requested.</p>${s.documents.map(d=>`<div class="doc"><div class="row"><div><h3>${esc(categoryName(d.category))}</h3><div class="doc-name">${esc(d.name)}</div><small class="muted">${d.pages} page${d.pages>1?'s':''} · ${Math.round(d.size/1024)} KB</small></div>${canEdit&&(d.category==='offer'?!isEmployee:isEmployee)?`<button class="secondary" data-remove="${d.id}">Remove</button>`:''}</div><div class="actions">${Array.from({length:d.pages},(_,i)=>`<button data-page="${d.id}:${i+1}">Page ${i+1}</button>`).join('')}<a class="button secondary" download="${esc(d.name)}" href="${fileUrl(d.id,'original')}">Original ↧</a></div></div>`).join('')||'<div class="empty"><p>No documents submitted yet.</p></div>'}${canEdit?`<form id="upload-form"><label for="document-category">Document type</label><select id="document-category">${isEmployee?'<option value="contract">Employment contract</option><option value="stay">Stay information</option><option value="residence">Residence evidence</option>':'<option value="offer">Company joining details</option>'}</select><label for="document-file">PDF or photo</label><input id="document-file" type="file" accept="application/pdf,image/jpeg,image/png" required><p class="help">PDF, JPEG or PNG · 10 MB max · 12 pages per document · 16 pages total. A new file replaces the current document of that type and starts a new version after analysis.</p><div class="actions"><button>Upload document</button></div></form><details><summary>Data handling</summary><p class="help">Redact unnecessary identifying numbers before upload. The original and rendered pages are stored for you and your assigned reviewer. Submitting sends the rendered pages to Nebius for AI analysis. Use “Delete case files” below to remove stored documents.</p></details>`:''}</details></section>${isEmployee&&['collecting','failed'].includes(s.stage)?`<section class="card soft" id="submit-section"><h2>Ready for an AI check?</h2><p>The agent reads your actual pages, checks dates and missing information, and gives you next steps.</p><label class="check"><input id="ai-consent" type="checkbox"><span>I have permission to submit these documents and consent to sending their page images, saved situation note and findings to Nebius Token Factory for analysis.</span></label><button id="submit-ai" ${!s.documents.length||!data.integration.configured?'disabled':''}>Submit & run AI</button><p class="help">${!data.integration.configured?'Live AI is not configured for this Workforce environment yet. The site owner must add the Nebius secret before analysis can run. ':''}${Math.ceil(s.documents.reduce((n,d)=>n+d.pages,0)/UPLOAD_LIMITS.pagesPerCall)} vision call(s), plus at most one English-draft call. Every page is included; no automatic paid retries. AI results are preliminary; the reviewer makes the final preparation decision.</p></section>`:''}${a?`<section class="card" id="analysis-section"><details class="plain-details" ${!isEmployee?'open':''}><summary>Document findings · ${a.issues.length} to check</summary>${analysisHTML(a)}</details></section>${correctionsHTML(s,isEmployee)}`:''}</div><div class="stack">${s.review?`<section class="card ${s.stage==='approved'?'soft':''}" id="reviewed-section"><p class="eyebrow">${s.review.decision==='approved'?'REVIEWED MESSAGE':'REVIEWER REQUEST'}</p><h2>${s.review.decision==='approved'?'Your packet has been reviewed':'What to update'}</h2><p class="message">${esc(s.review.message)}</p>${s.review.resolution?`<p class="help">Reviewer resolution: ${esc(s.review.resolution)}</p>`:''}<p class="help">Version ${s.review.version} · ${new Date(s.review.at).toLocaleString()}</p></section>`:''}${s.employee_note?`<section class="card" id="employee-note-section"><h3>Employee’s note</h3><p>${esc(s.employee_note)}</p></section>`:''}${a&&s.stage!=='approved'?`<section class="card" id="guidance-section"><details class="plain-details"><summary>English update draft</summary><p class="eyebrow">${!a.guidance?'CHECKED NEXT STEPS':a.guidance?.mode==='workflow_status'?'PREPARATION STATUS':s.stage==='approved'?'ORIGINAL AI DRAFT':'AI PREPARATION DRAFT'}</p><h2>Your next steps</h2>${a.guidance?`<p class="message">${esc(a.guidance.message)}</p>`:`<p class="message">${esc(checkedNextSteps(allGuidanceChecks(s)))}</p><p class="help">${esc(errors[a.guidance_error]||'The AI message could not be validated.')}</p>`}<p class="help">${!a.guidance?'Rule-based next steps from the findings · AI wording was unavailable.':a.guidance?.mode==='workflow_status'?'Rule-based workflow status · no text-generation call.':'AI-generated draft · not a reviewer decision.'} Nothing has been emailed.</p>${['needs_changes','ready_for_review'].includes(s.stage)?`<label class="check"><input id="guidance-consent" type="checkbox"><span>I consent to sending the saved situation note and current findings to Nebius for an updated English draft.</span></label><button id="refresh-guidance">Update AI guidance</button><p class="help">One text-model request. No document images are resent. Uses saved notes; save any edits first.</p>`:''}</details></section>`:''}${!isEmployee&&a&&['needs_changes','ready_for_review'].includes(s.stage)?`<section class="card" id="review-section"><p class="eyebrow">REVIEWER DECISION</p><h2>One review, one saved record</h2>${companyHTML(s)}<p class="help">Edit the message the employee will see. Approval records the preparation review, not immigration status or permission to work.</p><label for="review-message">Message to employee</label><textarea id="review-message" maxlength="1800">${esc(s.review_draft?.message||s.review?.message||a.guidance?.message||checkedNextSteps(allGuidanceChecks(s)))}</textarea><label for="resolution">Resolution of remaining findings</label><textarea id="resolution" maxlength="600" style="min-height:80px" placeholder="Explain any remaining finding you checked against the original.">${esc(s.review_draft?.resolution||'')}</textarea><label class="check"><input id="originals-reviewed" type="checkbox" ${s.review_draft?.originals_reviewed?'checked':''}><span>I compared the extracted facts with the original documents.</span></label><label class="check"><input id="flags-reviewed" type="checkbox" ${s.review_draft?.flags_reviewed?'checked':''}><span>I reviewed every finding and checked the applicable official guidance where needed.</span></label><label class="check"><input id="guidance-reviewed" type="checkbox" ${s.review_draft?.guidance_reviewed?'checked':''}><span>I reviewed the English message and understand the scope of this approval.</span></label><div class="actions">${s.profile?'<button id="save-review" class="secondary">Save review draft</button>':''}<button id="approve">Approve review</button><button id="request-changes" class="secondary">Request changes</button></div></section>`:''}${isEmployee&&a&&['needs_changes','ready_for_review'].includes(s.stage)?`<section class="card" id="ask-section"><details class="plain-details"><summary>Ask your reviewer</summary><h3>Need help with a finding?</h3><p class="help">You can ask your reviewer to check it without changing the source document.</p><label for="employee-note">Question for your reviewer</label><textarea id="employee-note" maxlength="600" style="min-height:85px"></textarea><button id="ask-reviewer">Ask reviewer</button></details></section>`:''}<section class="card" id="history-section"><details class="plain-details"><summary>History, downloads & audit</summary><h3>History & evidence</h3><p class="help">Each new submission is analyzed separately. Earlier approvals do not apply to a changed version.</p>${s.history.map(h=>`<details><summary>Version ${h.version} · ${esc(stages[h.stage])}</summary><p class="help">${h.analysis?.issues.length??'Not analyzed'} findings</p>${h.review?`<p class="message">${esc(h.review.message)}</p>`:''}${h.documents.map(d=>`<div class="doc"><strong>${esc(categoryName(d.category))}</strong><div class="actions">${Array.from({length:d.pages},(_,i)=>`<button data-page="${d.id}:${i+1}">Page ${i+1}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>`).join('')}</details>`).join('')}<div class="actions"><button id="show-audit" class="secondary">Verify audit trail</button>${s.stage==='approved'?'<button id="summary-export" class="secondary">Download preparation summary</button><button id="export" class="secondary">Download audit record (JSON)</button>':''}</div><div id="audit-output"></div>${s.stage!=='deleted'?'<details><summary>Delete stored files</summary><p class="help">Deletes all original files, page images and analysis for this case, including older versions. Both participants lose file access. Minimal review messages and audit events remain.</p><button id="purge" class="danger">Delete case files</button></details>':''}</details></section></div></div>`;
